Jews were blamed for the plague in times past,
et cetera, et cetera.

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:08.060
And also the idea sort of of the disease as
a personal failing, a human failing of some

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:10.490
kind, which can take some different forms.

00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:11.939
Maybe we can start there.

00:01:11.939 --> 00:01:18.000
Like what are the general trends that you
have studied and seen over time related to

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:20.400
infectious disease?

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:24.720
So you nailed a lot of them there, actually.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:32.869
You know, diseases, a personal failing is
a really old conception and disease as punishment

00:01:32.869 --> 00:01:36.259
is a really old concept.

00:01:36.259 --> 00:01:45.060
We've had that embedded in particularly Western
