00:13:17.769 --> 00:13:26.300
And so it is kind of quadruply frustrating
to then watch them become a way to write off

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:31.579
KOVA deaths because they're almost entirely
structurally linked.

00:13:31.579 --> 00:13:35.610
Comorbidities, I guess, is the best way to
