00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:36.670
Yeah, no question about that.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:39.380
And that's often missing from the science.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:43.300
Science can tell us a lot of the facts, but
it doesn't.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:48.660
It rarely tells us about the economic and
sociological factors that kind of led to those

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:49.660
being.

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:50.660
Being the facts.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:55.149
